# Local-only secrets for `npm run dev:full` (wrangler reads .dev.vars).
# Copy this file to `.dev.vars` and fill in your Apps Script web app URL.
# `.dev.vars` is gitignored and never deployed. In production, set SHEET_URL
# as a secret in the Cloudflare Pages dashboard instead.
#
# Leave SHEET_URL unset to fall back to the built-in sample data.
SHEET_URL=
